WEBVTT

00:01.042 --> 00:02.836
Do you know why you are all bad at math?

00:04.879 --> 00:06.506
It's because of reasoning.

00:07.716 --> 00:08.842
You all just memorize,

00:09.426 --> 00:11.052
without actually learning things.

00:17.225 --> 00:18.143
Oh Beom-seok.

00:18.935 --> 00:20.645
You're walking in at the end of class?

00:21.271 --> 00:22.188
I'm sorry.

00:24.315 --> 00:25.066
Anyway,

00:25.567 --> 00:27.694
I want you all to take time to think about

00:28.194 --> 00:29.904
why I said this today.

00:30.488 --> 00:31.364
Class President.

00:31.448 --> 00:32.490
Attention.

00:32.574 --> 00:33.324
Bow.

00:34.284 --> 00:35.535
Thank you.

00:41.541 --> 00:42.459
Beom-seok.

00:44.627 --> 00:45.462
Are you hung over?

00:47.130 --> 00:48.131
Beom-seok-a.

00:49.215 --> 00:50.133
Are you okay?

00:55.972 --> 00:57.682
Does it feel like your
head's gonna burst open?

00:57.766 --> 00:58.391
Yeah,

00:58.892 --> 00:59.976
I feel so sick.

01:02.979 --> 01:03.730
I don't-

01:04.230 --> 01:06.191
remember what happened last night.

01:07.442 --> 01:09.527
Bro, you were freaking
hilarious yesterday.

01:09.611 --> 01:10.820
Dude, and Yong-jin?

01:10.904 --> 01:12.614
He totally slept with that nuna.

01:13.198 --> 01:15.742
- Are you serious?
- Yeah, you don't you remember?

01:16.242 --> 01:18.745
- Yeah, you even paid for his motel.
- His motel?!

01:18.828 --> 01:19.537
- Yeah!
- Yeah.

01:19.621 --> 01:21.790
- Man, this dude.
- He legit doesn't remember.

01:22.499 --> 01:23.583
Let's go for a smoke.

01:24.250 --> 01:26.961
- Hey, thanks for the drinks.
- Yeah, seriously.

01:27.045 --> 01:28.630
I had a killer time yesterday.

01:29.130 --> 01:30.965
But I thought you were…

01:56.282 --> 01:58.493
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

02:56.885 --> 02:57.844
- Give it to me later.
- No, I can't.

02:57.927 --> 02:58.803
You said you would.

02:58.887 --> 03:01.347
- When'd I say that?
- Hey, what's our group number?

03:02.348 --> 03:03.266
Group six.

03:03.349 --> 03:05.018
Cool. I call dibs on the end seat.

03:11.524 --> 03:14.277
Hey, is Oh Beom not at school yet?

03:18.865 --> 03:19.782
He's here.

03:19.866 --> 03:20.700
He is?

03:21.492 --> 03:23.036
- Since when?
- Hey, Beom-seok-a.

03:23.119 --> 03:25.663
That nuna was mad groping
your thigh yesterday.

03:30.251 --> 03:31.669
Hey, have you even talked to her?

03:31.753 --> 03:32.629
What the hell?

03:32.712 --> 03:35.089
You were rapping so much at karaoke.
In English too.

03:35.173 --> 03:37.550
Yeah, we were like,
"What?" You must've had a

03:37.634 --> 03:38.885
lot of anger to get out.

03:38.968 --> 03:40.220
- We should go again.
- Yeah, the three of us

03:40.303 --> 03:42.222
- have to go without Yong-jin.
- Yeah seriously, bro.

03:42.305 --> 03:44.224
You made everything happen,
but Yong-jin stole your thunder.

03:44.307 --> 03:45.391
- Uh-huh.
- Like right--

03:48.102 --> 03:49.312
Can we talk for a sec?

03:53.942 --> 03:54.734
What's with you?

03:56.611 --> 03:57.528
What about me?

03:59.113 --> 04:00.990
Why won't you answer my calls?

04:02.325 --> 04:03.159
What?

04:04.869 --> 04:06.120
I didn't know you called.

04:09.082 --> 04:10.166
What's going on?

04:11.793 --> 04:13.544
Why're you suddenly friends with them?

04:13.628 --> 04:14.837
Jeong-chan and Tae-hun?

04:20.718 --> 04:22.136
That's none of your business.

04:28.434 --> 04:30.395
You, me and Su-ho should talk things out.

04:31.396 --> 04:32.480
I have nothing to say.

04:37.568 --> 04:39.904
He's looked down on me
since the moment we met.

04:41.281 --> 04:43.616
He's never even thought of me
as a friend to begin with.

04:43.700 --> 04:46.661
He probably thought of me as his
minion who just tags along.

05:01.426 --> 05:03.052
Talking shit behind my back, huh?

05:10.601 --> 05:12.312
What are you gonna do about it?

05:38.296 --> 05:40.715
- Drink it all, drink it all!
- Drink it all, drink it all!

05:40.798 --> 05:43.092
- Wooh.
- Wow, he's good.

05:44.093 --> 05:45.970
- Oooh.
- Ahhhhh.

05:46.596 --> 05:49.098
- Hey, you got a bottle for me too?
- Oh Beom-seok.

05:50.600 --> 05:51.559
It's been a while.

05:53.686 --> 05:54.312
Yeah,

05:54.812 --> 05:55.730
it's been a while.

05:56.689 --> 05:58.691
- Come sit here.
- Over here, Beom-seok-a.

06:06.741 --> 06:07.742
Oh Beom-seok's a friend,

06:07.825 --> 06:08.868
from my old school.

06:09.369 --> 06:10.703
His dad's Assemblyman Oh Jin-won.

06:10.787 --> 06:11.913
Who's that?

06:11.996 --> 06:14.040
You know, that assemblyman.

06:14.123 --> 06:16.751
- You know who that is.
- Oh, seriously?

06:16.834 --> 06:17.460
Yeah.

06:18.044 --> 06:20.463
- That's awesome.
- This is Seo-hyeon, Ji-an, and Su-a.

06:21.130 --> 06:22.507
Friends from my new school.

06:22.590 --> 06:23.716
This is Kang Woo-yeong,

06:24.217 --> 06:26.010
my friend, who'll make it to UFC.

06:27.178 --> 06:27.845
Uh-huh.

06:28.346 --> 06:29.806
You know "Physical Therapist Woo-yeong"?

06:29.889 --> 06:30.848
What?

06:30.932 --> 06:31.474
Um,

06:31.974 --> 06:32.809
physical therapy?

06:32.892 --> 06:34.727
Watch it later.

06:34.811 --> 06:37.146
It's his channel where he spars with
these idiots who think they're strong.

06:37.230 --> 06:38.147
Freaking hilarious.

06:39.232 --> 06:40.149
Nice to meet ya.

06:42.402 --> 06:43.027
Yeah,

06:43.528 --> 06:44.654
nice to meet you too.

06:47.615 --> 06:48.324
Oh, right.

06:48.825 --> 06:51.285
You're not friends with
Si-eun and Su-ho anymore?

06:53.079 --> 06:53.830
Uh-huh.

06:54.330 --> 06:54.914
What happened?

06:55.415 --> 06:56.624
You guys were pretty tight.

06:58.418 --> 07:00.837
Ahn Su-ho freaking thinks he's like,
king of the world.

07:01.337 --> 07:03.548
Ahn Su-ho's so full of himself.

07:04.966 --> 07:06.717
He thinks everyone is beneath him.

07:07.969 --> 07:10.012
I need to kick his fucking ass someday.

07:13.182 --> 07:13.975
Whatever.

07:15.017 --> 07:16.310
I'm sorry about before.

07:22.150 --> 07:23.234
Let's make a toast.

07:23.317 --> 07:23.860
Bottoms up!

07:24.360 --> 07:25.278
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

07:25.361 --> 07:28.156
- Woo!
- Fuck, I want to transfer schools too.

07:31.451 --> 07:33.119
Isn't he your type?

07:33.744 --> 07:36.038
"Some expert." A few select

07:36.122 --> 07:38.040
specialists. "Estimated."

07:38.541 --> 07:41.002
They guessed and approximated something.

07:41.711 --> 07:43.588
DAESUNG ACADEMY

07:48.176 --> 07:49.093
Hey, Si-eun-ssi!

08:01.063 --> 08:01.731
What's up?

08:02.231 --> 08:03.399
What do you think?

08:03.483 --> 08:04.233
It's Friday night.

08:04.317 --> 08:05.943
Let's go drive around tonight.

08:06.027 --> 08:06.694
Hm.

08:06.777 --> 08:07.653
Hop on.

08:17.663 --> 08:18.915
Cute. Mhm.

08:44.649 --> 08:45.525
Unit nine-o-one.

08:45.608 --> 08:46.317
Mm.

08:46.817 --> 08:49.779
Think of this as part of your training
and go take the stairs.

08:50.655 --> 08:52.698
- You're making me work?
- Bro, I wouldn't do that.

08:52.782 --> 08:55.076
I'm just trying to help you get in shape,
that's all.

08:58.829 --> 09:00.623
I've gotta make a stop over there.

09:05.878 --> 09:06.837
Hey, cheers.

09:12.593 --> 09:13.386
It's good, right?

09:24.730 --> 09:25.481
Oh, yeah.

09:25.982 --> 09:27.692
Is Yeong-i doing at good at work?

09:28.192 --> 09:28.859
Yeah.

09:29.360 --> 09:30.820
She's actually pretty good at it, man.

09:30.903 --> 09:32.446
She's great with the customers.

09:40.913 --> 09:41.831
It seems like…

09:44.500 --> 09:47.086
Jeong-chan and Tae-hun are taking
advantage of Beom-seok.

09:50.423 --> 09:51.257
And?

09:52.717 --> 09:55.344
I think he's been buying them
clothes and shoes, too.

09:56.429 --> 09:58.973
And they've been saying he
pays for all the drinks.

10:01.183 --> 10:02.602
He's been reeking of alcohol.

10:05.521 --> 10:07.315
What if Oh Beom's taking
advantage of them?

10:10.735 --> 10:11.611
I think

10:12.403 --> 10:15.114
that's what that guy's been
wanting from the beginning.

10:15.865 --> 10:17.700
He first latched on to me and you,

10:18.284 --> 10:19.994
because he wanted to be popular.

10:22.997 --> 10:25.124
He built up some cred,
hanging out with us.

10:30.504 --> 10:31.839
You really think that?

10:47.021 --> 10:48.189
You guys have fun this weekend?

10:48.272 --> 10:50.900
- Yeong-bin brought some pretty girls.
- You freaking traitors.

10:50.983 --> 10:53.277
- Hey, what about us?
- I'm gonna date her.

10:53.778 --> 10:54.737
Seriously?

10:55.237 --> 10:57.657
Stop living in your imagination,
you idiot.

10:57.740 --> 10:58.699
It's true love.

10:58.783 --> 11:01.661
- And she looks at me in a certain way.
- Yeah, she can't believe

11:01.744 --> 11:03.329
you're a high school kid.

11:03.412 --> 11:04.997
- You look like an elementary kid.
- Hey, I'd fight him if I were you.

11:05.081 --> 11:07.166
- C'mon let's fight.
- Hey, come and get it!

11:07.708 --> 11:09.502
Seo-hyeon's been keeping in touch with me.

11:09.585 --> 11:11.921
- Get outta here with that.
- Yeah fuckin' right!

11:12.004 --> 11:14.632
- What's she look like?
- I'm serious, we've been DMing.

11:14.715 --> 11:15.966
- No way.
- She messaged me first and

11:16.050 --> 11:17.009
wants to meet this weekend.

11:17.093 --> 11:18.010
- For real?
- Mhm.

11:18.552 --> 11:19.929
- Yeah right.
- What about us?

11:20.012 --> 11:20.888
Me too.

11:21.389 --> 11:22.765
- Everyone, except you.
- No, okay!

11:22.848 --> 11:24.433
- Hey, hey ask her to bring Su-a too.
- I believe you. I do. I do. I've

11:24.517 --> 11:25.851
- always believed you. You know me.
- Alright, I'll DM her.

11:25.935 --> 11:26.686
- I'll DM her right now.
- I like Ji-an.

11:26.769 --> 11:27.520
No, wait.

11:27.603 --> 11:28.938
- Not Ji-an, not Ji-an. I take it back.
- Tell her about us too.

11:29.021 --> 11:29.397
Let's not be greedy,
three girls is great.

11:29.480 --> 11:29.855
I want Su-a.

11:30.356 --> 11:31.273
What about us?

11:31.357 --> 11:32.566
Her profile pic is freaking hot!

11:32.650 --> 11:33.484
Ooh.

11:34.110 --> 11:35.152
- Come on, do it.
- Hurry.

11:35.236 --> 11:36.612
I'll message her later.

11:36.696 --> 11:38.197
- Aw, come on man, just do it!
- Hey, come on dude!

11:38.280 --> 11:41.200
- I'm serious, okay?
- Hey, Beom-seok-a, you moving over now?

11:52.712 --> 11:53.838
- Beom-seok-a.
- Ugh, you're annoying.

11:53.921 --> 11:55.089
- Hey, hurry up dude.
- Is it Su-a again?

11:55.172 --> 11:56.757
- Always.
- Of course.

11:56.841 --> 11:58.217
Hey, please ask Su-a to come.

11:58.300 --> 11:59.427
Isn't this seat great?

11:59.927 --> 12:01.429
Yeah, I love this seat.

12:02.596 --> 12:04.223
A hundred million won per pyeong.

12:04.890 --> 12:06.392
You have to treat us big time.

12:07.017 --> 12:08.102
For sure, this weekend.

12:08.185 --> 12:09.186
Cool.

12:09.687 --> 12:10.604
But not Tae-hun.

12:11.147 --> 12:12.106
I'm not going, then.

12:12.606 --> 12:14.859
Hey, hey, guys. We need to be a team.

12:16.360 --> 12:17.737
Stop treating him like that.

12:18.404 --> 12:19.238
What?

12:20.740 --> 12:21.949
You're using Beom-seok.

12:22.450 --> 12:25.786
- Ah, jeez.
- What the hell are you saying, dude?

12:26.370 --> 12:28.247
School's turning into
a pretty scary place.

12:28.748 --> 12:31.250
You've been making Beom-seok
pay for everything.

12:32.126 --> 12:36.046
- He's been buying your shoes and drinks.
- This guy's fucking making us the bad guy.

12:36.130 --> 12:36.964
Hey,

12:37.465 --> 12:39.675
he offered to buy us all that stuff, dude.

12:41.677 --> 12:42.803
I've made myself clear.

12:55.524 --> 12:56.859
Hey, let's grab a bite.

13:13.542 --> 13:15.044
Stop worrying about Beom-seok.

13:17.463 --> 13:18.297
What?

13:19.256 --> 13:20.132
You've done enough,

13:20.216 --> 13:21.217
for that guy.

13:26.222 --> 13:27.515
I think Beom-seok…

13:30.351 --> 13:31.977
did all that because he's lonely.

13:34.980 --> 13:36.398
I don't have the right words,

13:37.858 --> 13:38.984
but that's how I feel.

13:43.030 --> 13:43.989
- Up for b-ball later?
- Nah.

13:44.073 --> 13:45.407
What's for lunch? I'm starving.

13:45.908 --> 13:47.785
Man, gaenip. Fuck.

13:47.868 --> 13:49.787
Who wants to help me unstick mine?

13:54.750 --> 13:55.584
Hey.

14:00.172 --> 14:00.881
Hey!

14:07.513 --> 14:08.556
Get in line.

14:09.640 --> 14:10.558
You just cut.

14:23.737 --> 14:24.947
Get in line.

14:27.116 --> 14:27.950
Damn it.

14:28.450 --> 14:30.703
Come on let's get in line.

15:06.739 --> 15:07.907
I'm over this.

15:14.079 --> 15:15.623
Get in line, Beom-seok-a.

15:25.299 --> 15:26.133
No thanks.

15:38.145 --> 15:39.146
That's enough.

16:08.676 --> 16:09.551
Let's go.

16:09.635 --> 16:10.469
You okay, dude?

16:10.970 --> 16:12.638
Fuck that dude.

16:23.440 --> 16:26.443
Fuck this,
man! That asshole thinks everyone's

16:26.527 --> 16:28.904
freaking beneath him. Fuck.

16:32.533 --> 16:33.367
Hey.

16:34.910 --> 16:36.954
Do you know anybody who
could kick his ass?

16:37.454 --> 16:38.247
What?

16:38.747 --> 16:39.498
I'll pay. Do you know anybody who

16:39.581 --> 16:40.749
could kill that asshole?

16:43.585 --> 16:44.920
I do, fuck.

16:45.504 --> 16:47.256
- What?
- Woo-yeong.

16:48.007 --> 16:48.716
Hey,

16:49.216 --> 16:51.844
I watched his videos.
He's a freaking great fighter.

16:54.930 --> 16:55.806
Whoa, man.

16:55.889 --> 16:57.474
Right? Hey, hey. This
might fucking work. Huh?

16:57.558 --> 16:59.018
- Woah, jeez.
- He's strong.

17:01.770 --> 17:03.605
- He throws good punches.
- Wow.

17:06.650 --> 17:07.735
How much will you pay?

17:13.949 --> 17:15.451
Would a million won be enough?

17:23.834 --> 17:24.626
What day?

17:29.548 --> 17:30.591
This coming Saturday.

17:33.385 --> 17:34.470
It's Su-ho's birthday.

17:36.805 --> 17:37.848
Okay, sure.

17:40.225 --> 17:42.352
I'll stream the whole thing live,
no edits.

17:48.192 --> 17:48.817
Where you going?

17:48.901 --> 17:49.818
To workout.

17:51.070 --> 17:52.196
That's dedication.

17:55.199 --> 17:56.116
Wait a sec,

17:57.534 --> 17:59.912
didn't Woo-yeong get knocked
out by Su-ho before?

17:59.995 --> 18:01.121
In a tournament.

18:01.747 --> 18:03.582
That was forever ago.

18:04.249 --> 18:07.002
That guy's still fighting,
but Su-ho's been hangin' out.

18:07.086 --> 18:08.087
Come on.

18:08.587 --> 18:09.421
Hey,

18:10.005 --> 18:12.508
give him a handicap,
if you're so worried about it.

18:16.261 --> 18:17.304
Am I wrong?

18:29.191 --> 18:30.192
Delivery!

18:48.252 --> 18:48.877
Hey,

18:49.378 --> 18:50.587
is this it?

18:51.839 --> 18:54.007
Yeah, I think so. Hold on.

18:54.508 --> 18:57.302
- I'll do it. Fuck. Whatever.
- Can you hurry?

18:57.803 --> 18:59.888
It's hard to cut off. Darn it.

18:59.972 --> 19:01.306
Ugh. Dang it.

19:04.059 --> 19:05.269
Damn, I hope it's right.

19:05.853 --> 19:08.897
Uh, Fuck, what if he really dies?

19:09.648 --> 19:11.358
Then he fucking dies.

19:28.000 --> 19:28.792
Oh, fuck.

19:30.919 --> 19:31.753
Whoa.

19:34.423 --> 19:35.257
Whoa.

19:35.340 --> 19:36.175
Whoa!

19:43.015 --> 19:44.349
Move. Move!

19:49.771 --> 19:50.606
What?!

19:51.607 --> 19:52.774
- Woah.
- Oh my god.

19:57.112 --> 19:57.946
Are you okay?

19:58.447 --> 19:59.281
Hmm?

19:59.781 --> 20:02.534
- Someone call an ambulance.
- She's calling them right now.

20:02.618 --> 20:03.911
- Can you move?
- Do you know him?

20:05.162 --> 20:06.038
Hey, let's go.

20:06.121 --> 20:07.831
Or else we'll seriously be fucked.

20:13.086 --> 20:14.004
Hey, Beom-seok.

20:14.588 --> 20:15.422
Hey Hurry up.

20:28.769 --> 20:29.937
- I'm fine.
- You're okay?

20:31.021 --> 20:32.481
- I'm all right.
- That's a relief.

20:32.564 --> 20:34.274
Shouldn't he go see a doctor?

20:35.651 --> 20:39.029
What did I tell you all,
about Cheongsan Byeolgok?

20:46.411 --> 20:47.537
Did you just get here?

20:48.997 --> 20:50.082
I'm sorry.

20:51.625 --> 20:53.835
Eyes in front. Eyes in front!

20:55.462 --> 20:57.839
Let me break this down
for you one last time.

20:59.007 --> 21:02.511
It has a three-part harmony,
split into different verses with a chorus.

21:02.594 --> 21:05.430
This is a song that represents
the universal

21:05.514 --> 21:07.683
characteristics of Goryeo songs.

21:07.766 --> 21:09.101
Do you understand?

21:23.198 --> 21:25.492
Hey dude, come on, let's go.

21:26.952 --> 21:28.120
What happened to your leg?

21:28.203 --> 21:29.204
It's no big deal.

21:29.288 --> 21:30.205
Hm.

21:31.915 --> 21:32.499
Hey.

21:36.920 --> 21:38.213
Stop staring.

21:39.923 --> 21:40.882
You disgust me.

21:44.219 --> 21:45.137
Fuck off.

21:51.268 --> 21:52.144
What's that?

21:54.062 --> 21:54.896
It's nothing.

22:03.947 --> 22:04.614
Oh, fuck.

22:04.698 --> 22:06.033
That legit scared me.

22:06.867 --> 22:08.410
Do you think he knows it was us?

22:08.910 --> 22:10.579
No way. How would he know?

22:11.288 --> 22:13.248
He doesn't, right? Yeah, there's no way.

22:13.332 --> 22:15.625
Hey so,
Ahn Su-ho's birthday is in two days?

22:17.336 --> 22:18.128
Cool, I'm done.

22:19.004 --> 22:19.838
Okay.

22:21.506 --> 22:22.674
Ugh, Ahn Su-ho.

22:22.841 --> 22:24.926
We'd be in Yangyang without that accident.

22:26.053 --> 22:27.012
Take some pictures.

22:29.348 --> 22:30.349
Make me look pretty.

22:31.933 --> 22:34.144
People will see this and
think it's your birthday.

22:39.232 --> 22:40.275
Hurry up and take it.

22:45.614 --> 22:47.282
- And down.
- Take your time, alright?

22:47.366 --> 22:50.369
- One more squat. Hurry.
- Take your time, okay?

22:50.452 --> 22:51.870
Slow. Now, up here.

22:51.953 --> 22:53.497
Yeah dude, you got this.

22:55.207 --> 22:56.208
Weak ass.

22:57.000 --> 22:57.751
Hold it lower.

22:58.251 --> 22:59.169
One more.

22:59.669 --> 23:00.629
I'm tired.

23:00.712 --> 23:03.298
Hey, spot me next.
Come on, harder, hit harder.

